## Deal

`Deal extends Opportunity` — literal card adoption, so anything that lists Opportunities lists Deals too, and the stage enum lives on Opportunity. Adds the negotiation-phase fields: `terms` (markdown), `competitors` (containsMany string), `decisionMakers = linksToMany(Contact)`.

```ts
import { Deal } from '@cardstack/catalog/cards/commerce/deal';

@field deal = linksTo(Deal);
```

Inherits atom, embedded and fitted from Opportunity; overrides isolated to add the Decision Makers and Terms panels. Static format overrides in a subclass resolve correctly, so a Deal renders as a Deal wherever an Opportunity is expected.

**Non-goals:** contract legalese and priced line items (a Quote carries those), duplicate stage machinery — a Deal IS an Opportunity.

### Inverse links
`proposals`, `quotes` and `activities` are query-backed `linksToMany` fields of the Proposals and Quotes whose `deal`, and the Activities whose `about`, is this deal (read-only).
